  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "It's basically frogger.  You cross to the top of the screen to get a flag.  Go down and back up to get another flag.  5 flags finishes a scene.  Each scene has different enemies trying to stop you with different movement patterns/speeds.  Three scenes total, and if you beat the 3rd scene it takes you back to the first."
    }
